    "method_reference": "Brent-Dekker safeguarded linear interpolation with bisection fallback and Illinois-style consecutive-side stagnation dampening",
    "enclosure_guarantee": "Strict bracketing [l, r] maintained invariant. Secant proposal s = l + w * (r - l) where w = -fl / (fr - fl). Clamped to [0.125, 0.875] to enforce geometric progress. Degenerate denominators (|fr - fl| <= 1e-12) or consecutive stuck sides (stuck_count >= 2) immediately fallback to exact midpoint bisection.",
    "register_footprint": "Scalar-only: fr (1 float), stuck_count (1 u32), last_side (1 u32). Zero dynamic array allocation. Zero transcendental calls.",
    "protected_contracts": "Unchanged monotonicity admission (minSlope > 0), conservative root bands, true endpoint residuals, 0.0001 / adjacent-float termination, 32-step cap, work budget / refusal accounting, and whole-ray Current fallback."
